From: Luma maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] home: host shared Weather and Calendar widgets

Extract the existing Mobile widget model into luma-home-widgets and use its
GTK3 host here. Shell activation, appearance and Home placement stay native.
Apply after the maintained Home baseline containing luma-today.c.

--- a/src/luma-today.c
+++ b/src/luma-today.c
@@ -1,774 +1,49 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later */
-
-/* A native presentation of the shared Weather cache and Phosh CalendarServer.
- * No forecast requests, copied calendar database, polling or resident helper.
- */
-#define _GNU_SOURCE
+/* Phosh hosts the shared Home widgets; it owns application activation only. */
 #include "luma-today.h"
